      "description": "Shared arrow link with hover underline; homepage raises the minimum height from 44px to 48px.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-text-link\" href=\"/#how-works\">Explore Deviny<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a>",
