    {
      "name": "Homepage FAQ row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "home-faq",
      "description": "Current home FAQ: native independent details, regular-weight summary and rotating SVG marker. No separate hover color is authored.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-home-faq\"><summary>How do I start using Deviny?<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></summary><p>Deviny will be available in App Store and Google Play soon. After release, download the app and create an account.</p></details>",
