    },
    {
      "name": "Homepage people scenarios",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "home-need",
      "description": "Historical disclosure preview retained from the earlier homepage; the current people section is an open semantic split. Native FAQ disclosures remain in use.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-home-needs\"><details class=\"ds-home-need\" name=\"ds-home-needs\" open><summary>A training partner<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></summary><p>Look for someone to train with through GymBro. Add your preferences, get to know each other and confirm the connection if you want to train together.</p></details><details class=\"ds-home-need\" name=\"ds-home-needs\" ><summary>A trainer or nutritionist<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></summary><p>Get to know specialists through their experience, documents and programs. Choose an approach that suits your needs.</p></details><details class=\"ds-home-need\" name=\"ds-home-needs\" ><summary>Your community<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></summary><p>Share workouts in the feed, join discussions and find clubs around your interests. Follow people whose experience matters to you.</p></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-home-needs{--text:#232923;--muted:#596057;--line:#d4d8cd;--gold:#806124;font-family:'Deviny Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--text);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.ds-home-need{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.ds-home-need summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,1.9vw,1.75rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;gap:25px;padding:25px 0}.ds-home-need summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-home-need summary svg{color:var(--gold);width:24px;height:24px;flex:none;margin-top:4px;transition:transform .2s}.ds-home-need[open] summary svg{transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-home-need summary:hover{color:var(--gold)}.ds-home-need summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #89651d;outline-offset:5px}.ds-home-need>p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;padding:0 44px 28px 0;max-width:550px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-home-need summary{font-size:1.4rem;padding-block:23px}.ds-home-need>p{padding-right:30px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-home-need summary svg{transition:none}}"
    }
